{"version":1,"key":"card:251","content":{"id":251,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Symbol","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 变量可以作为对象的属性，但是当我们通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"for...in","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 以及 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"getOwnPropertyNames","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 都不能获得 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Symbol","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"let age = Symbol(\"age\");\nlet person = {\n  name: \"Alice\",\n  [age]: 28,\n};\n\nfor (let key in person) {\n  console.log(key); // name\n}\n\nconsole.log(Object.getOwnPropertyNames(person)); // [ 'name' ]","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"0bb5de9f-7d87-46ae-94fd-61a1c836e1bc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要获得 Symbol 类的属性，要通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.getOwnPropertySymbols","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"console.log(Object.getOwnPropertySymbols(person)); // [ Symbol(age) ]","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"54396f7f-0bcb-44e1-977b-9d0f1df58e87","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"],"createTime":1690986103939,"updateTime":1743303640412,"linkedCards":[{"id":249,"target":{"key":"card:249","type":"card","id":249},"summary":"Symbol 是 ES6 引入的一种新的原始类型，类型的值唯一的，每个被创建出来的 Symbol 变量都是不同的，这是 Symbol 这种数据类型最大的特点，常常用于作为对象的属性，以防止被不正确篡改。 Symbol 不能通过字面量来进行创...","tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640412}}